[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5997301596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124180#issuecomment-5997301596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124180","id":5997301596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZXePXA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T15:11:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:11:34Z","body":"CC @tdaven any thoughts?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5997301596/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6004625307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124180#issuecomment-6004625307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124180","id":6004625307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZedPmw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T22:39:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T22:50:30Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/54892,\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/56723,\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62887,\nand https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62794.\n\nI see two ways to fix this:\n\n- When low processor mode and texture streaming are both enabled, when a texture in view has more LOD levels to load, redraw constantly until we get some kind of signal that all textures in the current view are fully loaded, or when the specified memory limit has been reached.\n- If getting this signal is too difficult, then keep redrawing for a few seconds when texture streaming is enabled, irrespective of what caused the redraw. It's a bit wasteful but better than nothing.\n\nSee https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93966 for an implementation of a similar mechanism for volumetric fog.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6004625307/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6008703232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124180#issuecomment-6008703232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124180","id":6008703232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZiWJAA","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T03:25:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T03:25:22Z","body":"Yeah....if the view port doesn't refresh it can't update anything since it is driven by the feedback from rendering.  Sounds like in general we need a better framework in place for different things to signal they need rendering.  I'll take a look.\n\nI'm more thinking of a way for thing register a \"still rendering\" callback to signal they are actively rendering.  It just needs to signal the viewport to render but the actual logic that drives that can be specific to source.  It could be number of frames.  It could be a deadline.  It could the number of items queued.\n\nThe idea being provide the infrastructure, wire it up to streaming, sdfi, fog, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6008703232/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]